   "text": "Thank you, Aisha. Your identity is verified, and I've looked into order Q-7101 from Saffron Lane.\n\n- It was promised for 6:30 PM but handed to you at 7:20 PM, which is 50 minutes late.\n- Because it was more than 45 minutes late, you're owed 20% of the food subtotal ($44.50), which is **$8.90**.\n- I've added **$8.90 in account credit** to your Forkful account for use on future orders. Your balance is now $8.90.\n\nLate compensation is paid as account credit, not back to your card. I'm sorry the dinner arrived so late."
  },
